    // after A-held's 57. ----
    /// **A top-up of a class's Activation Pool** (tag 58): `amount` sompi its carrier paid into the
    /// output at `sink_index`, whose script is `OP_RETURN OP_DATA8 "MSKACT01" OP_DATA64 <class_id>`
